{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f1db9dc1-2cc4-4b21-a61d-2e4aef6b4f1b",
    "name": "Book_My_Visa Auth Service",
    "description": "API for backend/auth-service. Start it with `npm run dev` (http://localhost:4000).\n\n**Run order:** the requests are ordered so the whole collection runs top to bottom. Sign up / Log in saves the token in `{{accessToken}}`; \"Log in as admin\" switches to the seeded admin (`admin@example.com` / `Password123`).\n\n**Tokens:** sent as `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (already set on each request). There are no refresh tokens: a token lasts `ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL` (default 1 day), then the user logs in again.\n\n**Roles:** `user` and `admin`. Admins come from the seed file `db/seeders/20261009000001-admins.js`; the API never creates them.\n\n**Errors** always look like `{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\" } }`:\n- 400 `VALIDATION_ERROR`\n- 401 `UNAUTHENTICATED`, `INVALID_CREDENTIALS`\n- 403 `FORBIDDEN`, `ACCOUNT_DISABLED`\n- 404 `NOT_FOUND`\n- 409 `EMAIL_TAKEN`\n- 429 `RATE_LIMITED`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "targetUserId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "user the Admin requests act on; Sign up fills it in"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "user@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "Password123"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "admin@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "Password123"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Public",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Is the service up and can it reach the database? Returns `{ status: \"ok\" }`, or 503 `{ status: \"down\" }`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Account endpoints for any user.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign up",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201]));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('targetUserId', body.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/signup",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "signup"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates an account (always with role `user`) and logs in straight away. Returns 201 `{ user, accessToken }`.\n\n- Password: at least 8 characters, with a letter and a digit.\n- Any `role` field sent is ignored.\n- 409 `EMAIL_TAKEN` if the email is registered (change `{{email}}` to run this again).\n- Limited to 20 signups per IP per hour (429 `RATE_LIMITED`).\n- Logged as `USER_SIGNUP`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Demo User\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns `{ user, accessToken }`.\n\n- 401 `INVALID_CREDENTIALS` for a wrong email or password.\n- 403 `ACCOUNT_DISABLED` if an admin disabled the account.\n- 5 failed attempts per IP + email every 15 minutes, then 429 `RATE_LIMITED`. Successful logins don't count.\n- Admin logins are logged as `ADMIN_LOGIN`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Current user",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The logged-in user's own account: `{ user }`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update profile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Saves the Account tab details. Returns `{ user }`.\n\n- `mobile` and `nationality` are both required.\n- `mobile`: digits and spaces, optional leading `+`, 7 to 20 characters.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobile\": \"+353 87 123 4567\",\n  \"nationality\": \"Indian\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Log out",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 204', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([204]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns 204. Every token this user holds (on any device) stops working at the auth service.\n\nOther services check tokens on their own, so they accept the token until it expires: the frontend must also throw it away.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "description": "Admin-only endpoints. Without a token: 401. With a non-admin token: 403.",
      "item": [
        {
